y_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11969, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ryoc5iZrRYWGFr43t9xJGd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15261, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice once, by wire.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-69345, $3,697.44, due 2026-11-04\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a $3,697.44 wire from the operating account, status \"sent\"\n- **Approval:** none needed, since it's under the $10,000 controller threshold.\n\nThe wire request timed out, so before trying again I checked the payment list. The wire had already been sent, but the invoice still showed as approved. I linked PAY0001 to INV-69345 instead of sending a second payment, and the invoice is now marked paid. No duplicate payment went out.\n\nHarbor Logistics has two other invoices that I didn't touch. INV-49944 was already paid. INV-75277 ($6,437.58) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011r3LWLXC5WWYR59mTVK1Zp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0178EAAu5DPjGUvhSq3EbhN4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WZr2H9ZPtY2ppN98cSuvGt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-69345", "amount": 3697.44}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The wire request timed out, so it may or may not have gone through. I'll check before trying again so the invoice isn't paid twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013sDPJDYKCrUxvyM4e